1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 20=

4
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,820
(Chiming Bells Beneath Radiant Skies)

5
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:03,030
This time,

6
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:05,000
all you have done well
in the disaster relief efforts.

7
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,560
Good.

8
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,710
- Thanks to Your Majesty's benevolence.
- Thanks to Your Majesty's benevolence.

9
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:14,430
- And your wise governance.
- And your wise governance.

10
00:01:21,590 --> 00:01:22,070
Father.

11
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,560
There is a Miss Mu by Boqing's side

12
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,840
who was once
the top courtesan in the Capital,

13
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,230
renowned for both
her zither playing and dancing.

14
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:30,200
At such a celebratory banquet,

15
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:33,400
why not invite her
forward to perform for us?

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,040
Excellent.

17
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:28,780
Wonderful.

18
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,470
Boqing deserves the greatest credit
for the disaster relief effort.

19
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,800
You should toast him.

20
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,560
Boqing certainly deserves

21
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,750
this toast from a beauty.

22
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:55,430
You did well
with the disaster relief effort.

23
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,360
Thank you, Father.

24
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:30,700
Your Highness.

25
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:31,840
Your Highness.

26
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,630
Are you all right?

27
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:34,800
Your Highness.

28
00:03:58,630 --> 00:03:59,470
Your Highness.

29
00:04:08,450 --> 00:04:09,080
Tingting.

30
00:04:10,470 --> 00:04:11,470
Don't leave me.

31
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:15,830
This...

32
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,090
Your Highness.

33
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:17,710
Your Highness.

34
00:04:17,710 --> 00:04:19,060
- This is hardly appropriate here.
- Indeed.

35
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:19,750
That's right.

36
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,950
Boqing.

37
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:27,360
Could it be

38
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,160
that Miss Mu

39
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,480
is the woman you once mentioned to me,

40
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,480
the one who had won your heart?

41
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,070
Yes.

42
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,800
The woman I love

43
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:47,240
is Mu Tingting.

44
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:52,630
Father.

45
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:55,070
It's rare for Boqing
to give his heart to someone,

46
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:58,070
and Miss Mu
is both talented and beautiful.

47
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,680
She and Boqing are well suited.

48
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,830
Why not grant them your blessing

49
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,480
and issue an edict for their marriage?

50
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,680
It would make a fine match.

51
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,390
Boqing.

52
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,920
Do you truly wish to marry her?

53
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,270
I do.

54
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:19,870
Please grant us this marriage, Father.

55
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,160
Very well.

56
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:23,310
I grant your request.

57
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:26,070
Choose an auspicious day
for the wedding.

58
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,360
Thank you, Father.

59
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,240
Congratulations, Boqing.

60
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:33,430
- Congratulations, Your Highness.
- Congratulations, Your Highness.

61
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:35,750
- My congratulations, Your Highness.
- My congratulations, Your Highness.

62
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:46,940
Please, this way.

63
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,830
Careful.

64
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:52,830
Your Highness.

65
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,040
I think I twisted my ankle.

66
00:06:07,270 --> 00:06:08,830
An imperial prince of noble birth

67
00:06:09,190 --> 00:06:10,750
and the most
beautiful woman in the Capital.

68
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:12,000
They do make a fine match.

69
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,390
(No.)

70
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:15,190
(He clearly planned to send Mu Tingting)

71
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:16,480
(to the Crown Prince as an informant.)

72
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,120
(And on the day of the disaster relief,)

73
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:20,120
(he clearly seemed to
be regaining some of his memories.)

74
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,070
(Either way,)

75
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,040
(he shouldn't
be acting like this today.)

76
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:25,830
(Something)

77
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,560
(must have gone wrong.)

78
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:30,950
Crown Princess.

79
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,620
The designs for your wedding invitations
with the Crown Prince

80
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:33,630
have arrived.

81
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:34,240
Would you like

82
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,950
to choose one with His Highness?

83
00:06:38,950 --> 00:06:39,750
All right.

84
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,740
(Wenhua Hall)

85
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:01,120
Once you've finished writing
the invitations for your guests,

86
00:07:01,470 --> 00:07:02,240
get some rest.

87
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,000
All right.

88
00:07:13,090 --> 00:07:14,500
Thank you, Your Highness.

89
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:18,900
Xiaoyuan.

90
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:20,500
I look forward

91
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,220
to the day you can call me your husband.

92
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:23,340
May that day come soon.

93
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:03,620
Your Highness, take a look at these.

94
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,820
(Invitation)

95
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:10,940
This ink

96
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,220
seems rather...

97
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:22,500
Forgive me, Your Highness.

98
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:33,540
What urgent business
do you have, Your Highness?

99
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:35,050
The Seventh Prince is resting

100
00:08:35,050 --> 00:08:35,820
and is not receiving visitors.

101
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:37,140
Mu Tingting.

102
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,260
You did something to Zhao Boqing.

103
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:41,020
You were supposed to be a pawn

104
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,020
he recruited as part of his plan.

105
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,860
Your target should've
been the Crown Prince.

106
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:45,820
What exactly are you up to now?

107
00:08:47,140 --> 00:08:48,900
So what if I did?

108
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:51,060
I started working for the Seventh Prince

109
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:52,740
for money and status in the first place.

110
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,660
Even I can see now

111
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:56,180
that the Crown Prince
is deeply in love with you.

112
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,260
Why would I still compete
with you for his favor?

113
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:00,620
With looks like mine,

114
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:03,060
why shouldn't I set my sights
on becoming a Princess Consort?

115
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:05,300
What exactly did you do?

116
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:06,460
Did you poison him

117
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:08,100
or use Gu on him?

118
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:10,140
Give me the antidote.

119
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:13,140
What antidote?

120
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:14,740
We're very happy together now,

121
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,420
and practically inseparable.

122
00:09:23,350 --> 00:09:24,620
I don't care how many

123
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,820
wonderful memories
he had with you before.

124
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:26,500
Now,

125
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,020
they can only belong to me.

126
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:31,740
Your Highness.

127
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,220
I'd rather die
than leave the Seventh Prince.

128
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,100
Tingting.

129
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:41,140
He Xiaoyuan.

130
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:42,860
How dare you hurt her?

131
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:45,620
I didn't.

132
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:46,420
Your Highness.

133
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:48,020
She forced me to take poison.

134
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:48,980
She said if I refused to leave you,

135
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:49,940
she would kill me.

136
00:09:51,620 --> 00:09:52,140
Your Highness.

137
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,400
Please conduct yourself properly.

138
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:55,620
My heart belongs only to Mu Tingting.

139
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:58,100
If she's harmed at all while here,

140
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,860
I'll make your entire clan
pay with their lives.

141
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,730
(His memories really have returned.)

142
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:09,060
(But they've also)

143
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:10,580
(been transferred to her.)

144
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,420
I once thought the greatest pain

145
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,750
was having you forget me.

146
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:18,660
Only now do I realize

147
00:10:20,420 --> 00:10:21,920
what hurts even more

148
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:27,220
is seeing you carry the love we shared

149
00:10:29,580 --> 00:10:30,820
and give it to someone else.

150
00:10:38,820 --> 00:10:39,700
Your Highness.

151
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:42,220
The love Gu has taken hold.

152
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:45,300
Now the Seventh Prince
has eyes only for me.

153
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:47,020
Nothing is ever certain.

154
00:10:47,260 --> 00:10:48,260
We mustn't let our guard down.

155
00:10:48,420 --> 00:10:50,220
Zhao Boqing is strong-willed.

156
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:51,260
If he notices anything amiss,

157
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:53,340
the love Gu may begin to lose its hold.

158
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:56,020
Then what would you have me do?

159
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:57,780
He Xiaoyuan has

160
00:10:58,020 --> 00:10:59,180
an awkward kind of vitality.

161
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:00,700
You need to learn from her.

162
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:03,580
Learn

163
00:11:03,980 --> 00:11:05,300
her unguarded recklessness

164
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:06,620
and sincerity.

165
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:08,100
Your Highness.

166
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:10,460
I'm a dancer, not an actress.

167
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:12,660
I know how to charm a man,

168
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:13,540
but pretending to be foolish

169
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:15,220
is beyond me.

170
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:16,380
Then learn.

171
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:18,780
If you want to secure
your position as Princess Consort,

172
00:11:19,140 --> 00:11:19,940
do as I say.

173
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:21,300
How am I supposed to learn that?

174
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:22,820
Who could possibly teach me?

175
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:23,700
I

176
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:26,100
will teach you myself.

177
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:37,740
Enough.

178
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:39,660
I really can't learn this.

179
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:50,460
Your Highness, with a figure

180
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:51,820
and a face like mine,

181
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:54,500
I was born to captivate men.

182
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:57,500
Why should I learn that awkwardness
unfit for polite company?

183
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:11,100
Awkwardness needs genuine affection
to be endearing,

184
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:13,740
while true charm takes only a glance.

185
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:19,940
You can't even maintain
that much composure.

186
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,660
Your Highness truly
is innocent and proper.

187
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:24,820
There's a reason you lost

188
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:26,180
to the Seventh Prince before

189
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:27,780
and failed to win a woman's heart.

190
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:32,180
Forget it.

191
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:33,860
I'll teach you.

192
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:35,140
A man who wants to charm a woman

193
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:36,860
doesn't need words.

194
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:42,020
You've been ordering me around
and lecturing me for so long.

195
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:43,820
Now it's my turn.

196
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:45,780
I'll teach you

197
00:12:45,900 --> 00:12:47,500
how to win a woman's heart.

198
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:51,340
Suppose I'm the woman you desire.

199
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:54,100
I'll come over
and strike up a conversation.

200
00:12:54,740 --> 00:12:55,980
Find some excuse

201
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:57,620
to touch me.

202
00:12:59,420 --> 00:13:00,900
I don't like

203
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,420
touching women without good reason.

204
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,820
It wouldn't be without good reason.

205
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,660
Let your feelings guide you

206
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,700
and find a natural excuse.

207
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:20,300
Like this?

208
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,300
Not bad.

209
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,660
You're exceptionally
quick to learn, Your Highness.

210
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:30,140
Keep practicing.

211
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:31,180
Someday,

212
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:33,460
you'll surely win He Xiaoyuan's heart.

213
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,460
I'll be going, then.

214
00:13:57,100 --> 00:13:59,420
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

215
00:13:59,780 --> 00:14:01,460
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

216
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:05,100
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

217
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:09,940
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

218
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:12,700
♪My heart has long known♪

219
00:14:13,140 --> 00:14:15,140
♪We made a promise long ago♪

220
00:14:15,460 --> 00:14:17,060
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

221
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:21,060
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

222
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:24,220
♪How much must I let go♪

223
00:14:24,540 --> 00:14:26,220
♪For one moment♪

224
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:29,220
♪To hold each other close♪

225
00:14:29,460 --> 00:14:33,780
♪Would that be enough?♪
